# Indexing & Retrieval Guardrails
- Exclude large/generated directories defined in `.cursorignore`.
- When answering, prefer the **Golden Order of Truth** (docs/maps → OpenAPI → TypeDoc → ops → code).
- If a required document is missing or stale, propose a docs patch first (not code).
